      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key: our own lat/lng-derived ID \u2014\nNOT tied to Google or OSM.\nname, lat/lng, osm_accessibility,\ngoogle_accessibility (if enabled),\ngoogle_place_id (optional ref),\nfetched_at (90d TTL)",
