      "originalText": "Aggregates reviews + routes into IMDF-shaped GeoJSON:\nUnit (walkway/room), Opening (accessible: true/false),\nAmenity (elevator, accessible restroom).\nSelf-hosted \u2014 NOT submitted to Apple, no review needed.\nRegenerates whenever venue_imdf_archives.is_stale is set.",
